  "readmeHtml": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">The Unicity Astrid OS Contributor Handbook</h1></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">How to work on Unicity Astrid OS: the polyrepo, the kernel-is-dumb law, the RFC trigger, contribution tiers, and the release process.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Built with <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook\">mdBook</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"mdbook serve --open\"><pre>mdbook serve --open</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Dual-licensed under <a href=\"https://github.com/astrid-runtime/handbook/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT\">MIT</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/astrid-runtime/handbook/blob/main/LICENSE-APACHE\">Apache 2.0</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Joshua J. Bouw and Unicity Labs.</p>\n</article></div>",
